    "latex": "\\mathcal{I}(X\\times Y)=\\langle f_{1},\\ldots,f_{k},g_{1},\\ldots,g_{\\ell}\\rangle\n    \\subseteq K[x_{1},\\ldots,x_{m},y_{1},\\ldots,y_{n}]."
